{"availability":"available","full":"alshedivat/al-folio","name":"al-folio","description":"A beautiful, simple, clean, and responsive Jekyll theme for academics","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":16254,"forks":13069,"created":"2016-05-30T16:32:46Z","updated":"2026-10-12T12:06:26Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://alshedivat.github.io/al-folio/","topics":["academic","academic-website","github-pages","hacktoberfest","jekyll","jekyll-blog","jekyll-theme","personal-website","portfolio-website","theme"],"demo":"https://alshedivat.github.io/al-folio/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:48.582Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:48.582Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:48.582Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T02:04:08.698Z","stars":16235,"forks":13069},{"at":"2026-10-16T05:06:48.582Z","stars":16254,"forks":13069}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A simple, clean, and responsive Jekyll starter for academic websites.","In v1.x, al-folio is a thin starter, not a theme: the runtime ships as independently versioned plugin gems, so you pick up fixes and features by bumping a pinned version in your Gemfile instead of merging theme internals into your site."],"features":["Also included: Open Graph and schema.org previews, an Atom feed at /feed.xml, related posts, tabbed content, typograms, responsive image generation, and a Google Scholar citation-refresh workflow.","The theme follows the visitor's system preference and can be toggled with the sun/moon control in the navbar. The choice persists across visits.","Publications are generated from your BibTeX bibliography, the CV from a single cv.yml or resume.json, and the people page from data. Everything is content-driven — you edit data files, not templates.","Projects are one of four Jekyll collections the starter ships (news, projects, books, teachings). You can add your own for courses, talks, or anything else — see Adding Collections.","Posts support the distill.pub layout, MathJax and TikZ, syntax-highlighted code, Jupyter notebooks, charts, image galleries, video and audio embeds."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alshedivat/al-folio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f76c2ec5e5585103b9dba5bbe7050f4db7f326fd912a4677111dca6604475792","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T02:04:08.822Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:48.681Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A simple, clean, and responsive Jekyll starter for academic websites.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alshedivat/al-folio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Profile trophies via github-profile-trophy are supported but off by default, because that project's free public instance is currently disabled — see docs/CUSTOMIZE.md to self-host and re-enable.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alshedivat/al-folio/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"f76c2ec5e5585103b9dba5bbe7050f4db7f326fd912a4677111dca6604475792","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alshedivat/al-folio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:48.682Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T12:06:26Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alshedivat/al-folio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:48.683Z","hash":"f76c2ec5e5585103b9dba5bbe7050f4db7f326fd912a4677111dca6604475792","originalBytes":22690,"storedBytes":22690,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:06:48.582Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:40.335Z","latestRelease":{"name":"al-folio v1.2","tag":"v1.2","publishedAt":"2026-08-09T11:52:29Z","url":"https://github.com/alshedivat/al-folio/releases/tag/v1.2"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:40.335Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/7f3f3c94b13e5589e9b4aa3e.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-16T05:29:35.084Z","url":"https://alshedivat.github.io/al-folio/"},{"src":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alshedivat